 9|  Enter                       - ssh to the selected host
10|  Esc, Ctrl-C, Ctrl-G, Ctrl-Q - quit (exit 130); Esc closes this help first
11|  Up, Ctrl-P, Ctrl-K          - select the previous host; wraps to the last
12|  Down, Ctrl-N, Ctrl-J        - select the next host; wraps to the first
13|  type                        - filter; 'exact ^prefix suffix$ !not
14|  Backspace, Ctrl-H           - delete the last character
15|  Ctrl-U                      - clear the filter
16|  Ctrl-W                      - delete the last word
17|  Ctrl-D                      - quit when the filter is empty
18|  ?, F1                       - toggle this help (? only on an empty filter)
19|  ↑↓ move   enter ssh   esc close
